Description: Acer RGB Keyboard Backlight and Turbo Mode kernel module (DKMS)
 Unofficial Linux Kernel Module for Acer Gaming RGB Keyboard Backlight
 and Turbo Mode (Acer Predator / Nitro).
 .
 This package installs the driver source using DKMS so it is automatically
 rebuilt for every installed kernel.
